{
 "fps": 30,
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "n01",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "This is the tallest hotel in North Korea.",
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 2.24
  },
  {
   "id": "n02",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "It has never had a single guest.",
   "start": 2.49,
   "end": 4.347
  },
  {
   "id": "n03",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "One hundred and five floors. Zero check-ins.",
   "start": 4.697,
   "end": 7.205
  },
  {
   "id": "s01",
   "spk": "guest",
   "text": "Do you have a room?",
   "start": 7.555,
   "end": 8.763
  },
  {
   "id": "s02",
   "spk": "clerk",
   "text": "We have a hundred and five floors.",
   "start": 9.063,
   "end": 11.292
  },
  {
   "id": "s03",
   "spk": "guest",
   "text": "So... yes?",
   "start": 11.642,
   "end": 12.524
  },
  {
   "id": "s04",
   "spk": "clerk",
   "text": "No.",
   "start": 12.974,
   "end": 13.671
  },
  {
   "id": "n04",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "But here's the strange part. Every night, it lights up.",
   "start": 14.271,
   "end": 16.964
  },
  {
   "id": "n05",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "A light show. Zero guests.",
   "start": 17.264,
   "end": 19.075
  },
  {
   "id": "n06",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "So why build it? And why can't they finish it?",
   "start": 19.375,
   "end": 22.022
  },
  {
   "id": "n07",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "Singapore opens the world's tallest hotel. A South Korean company built it.",
   "start": 25.722,
   "end": 30.134
  },
  {
   "id": "n08",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "North Korea reportedly wants a taller one. Work starts in nineteen eighty-seven.",
   "start": 30.434,
   "end": 34.985
  },
  {
   "id": "n09",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "Then, in nineteen ninety-two, the money runs out.",
   "start": 35.285,
   "end": 38.49
  },
  {
   "id": "n10",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "Its Soviet ally has collapsed. For sixteen years, it's a bare concrete pyramid.",
   "start": 38.79,
   "end": 43.48
  },
  {
   "id": "n11",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "By twenty eleven, an Egyptian firm wraps it in glass. It's a wrapped present. Shiny paper. Empty box.",
   "start": 43.73,
   "end": 51.671
  },
  {
   "id": "n12",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "In twenty twelve, a hotel chain signs on. Months later, it pulls out.",
   "start": 51.921,
   "end": 55.962
  },
  {
   "id": "s05",
   "spk": "guest",
   "text": "Opening date?",
   "start": 56.262,
   "end": 57.283
  },
  {
   "id": "s06",
   "spk": "clerk",
   "text": "Soon.",
   "start": 57.583,
   "end": 58.419
  },
  {
   "id": "s07",
   "spk": "guest",
   "text": "Which year?",
   "start": 58.769,
   "end": 59.559
  },
  {
   "id": "s08",
   "spk": "clerk",
   "text": "...Soon.",
   "start": 60.109,
   "end": 60.845
  },
  {
   "id": "n13",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "Tonight, over a hundred thousand lights switch on. A giant flag glows at the top.",
   "start": 61.445,
   "end": 66.089
  },
  {
   "id": "n14",
   "spk": "narr",
   "text": "And every room is still empty.",
   "start": 66.439,
   "end": 67.972
  }
 ],
